  "description": "500W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi XT750 SPORT is powered by a 500W high-speed brushless motor, offering strong performance that effortlessly tackles 30° inclines and cruises smoothly on flat city roads. The brushless design reduces friction and wear compared to traditional brushed motors, ensuring a quieter and more seamless riding experience.\n\n48V 20Ah SAMSUNG Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi XT750 SPORT is equipped with a 48V 12.8Ah lithium-ion battery made from 18650 cells, providing a range of up to 110 km in pedal-assist mode, perfectly suited for daily urban commuting.\n\nFront Fork Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi XT750 SPORT features an adjustable aluminum fork that improves comfort by absorbing shocks and vibrations from rough urban terrain, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable ride. The customizable suspension adapts to various road conditions, enhancing overall comfort and handling.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
